                                            <h2>
                                                <a href=/consumer-finance/consumer-credit/211116-fintech-and-financial-inclusion>
                                                    Fintech and Financial Inclusion
                                                </a>
                                            </h2>
                                                    <div class="article-authors-date">
                                                        <p class="article-author-by">by</p>
                                                        <ul class="authors">
<li class="author"><a href="/our-people/patrick-t-harker" itemprop="author">Patrick T. Harker</a></li>                                                        </ul>
                                                        <p class="article-date">16 Nov ’21</p>
                                                    </div>
                                        </header>
                                        <p class="article-excerpt">The Fifth Annual Fintech Conference | Virtual Event</p>
