                                                <a href=/banking/210401-linking-community-banks-and-fintech-platforms>
                                                    Linking Community Banks and Fintech Platforms
                                                </a>
                                            </h2>
                                                    <div class="article-authors-date">
                                                        <p class="article-author-by">by</p>
                                                        <ul class="authors">
<li class="author"><a href="/our-people/patrick-t-harker" itemprop="author">Patrick T. Harker</a></li>                                                        </ul>
                                                        <p class="article-date">01 Apr ’21</p>
                                                    </div>
                                        </header>
