                                                <a href=/consumer-finance/consumer-credit/a-survey-of-fintech-research-and-policy-discussion>
                                                    A Survey of Fintech Research and Policy Discussion
                                                </a>
                                            </h2>
                                                    <div class="article-authors-date">
                                                        <p class="article-author-by">by</p>
                                                        <ul class="authors">
<li class="author"><span itemprop="author">Franklin Allen</span>,&nbsp;</li><li class="author"><span itemprop="author">Xian Gu</span>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;</li><li class="author"><a href="/our-people/julapa-jagtiani" itemprop="author">Julapa Jagtiani</a></li>                                                        </ul>
                                                        <p class="article-date">February 2021</p>
                                                    </div>
                                        </header>
                                        <p class="article-excerpt">WP 20-21/R - The intersection of finance and technology, known as fintech, has resulted in the dramatic growth of innovations and has changed the entire financial landscape.</p>
